node_modules/
dist/
dist-example/
# The workspace has two tiers (docs/architecture/multi-user-context.md):
# local/ is per-developer runtime state and stays out of git; shared/ is the
# team's accumulated knowledge (changelog, learned playbooks, promotion
# decisions, eval baselines) and is committed.
_fleet/*
!_fleet/shared/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
# A local RelataDB instance (v0.7.0 G1 dev/testing) defaults to a relative
# data dir when its cwd is this repo root — never real fleetsmith data, but
# real database WAL/segment files that must never land in git regardless.
/data/
# Scratch workspace for the G4.4 live-exec eval scenario (test/grid-eval-exec.test.js)
# — the test deletes this itself in a finally block, this is only a safety net.
/.grid-eval-scratch/
